{"version":1,"key":"card:683","content":{"id":683,"content":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"eaa32c03-36ba-47e1-a46f-495bcc926711","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肿瘤和癌症的关系。其实二者是两种分类："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"776d031b-7882-481e-acf5-06e4fd3e9a08","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"82851827-f915-414e-9e67-5486ca7c7199","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"5f1d100a-9031-4acd-981a-ffbd5b8e7918","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肿瘤表示固体"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"35ee1bfb-64fe-4085-a414-5aa702948b4b","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"821a53ae-6cf8-414b-b5c3-9a6279329265","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"癌症表示恶性"}]}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"20fbf8fc-097d-404f-b8b7-2af8eef1c9e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肿瘤不一定是恶性，因此肿瘤≠癌症，恶性肿瘤才是癌症，除了恶性肿瘤外，癌症还包括血癌。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"0e26ec71-8f47-4fcc-aad5-625f68b5e78c","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"f62d80fe-1391-47e7-9723-17ae34fb56d2","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"262f4bfd-e2ff-499b-a898-6ded6d9fb624","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"癌症＝恶性肿瘤+血癌"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"bc5a7ef1-075e-4a44-a02a-a6ad4a0f297a","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"728d7d45-9fcb-43a6-9842-08e513d79eb7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肿瘤＝良性肿瘤+恶性肿瘤"}]}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"d9fc4271-56a3-4386-9a27-151c8bb36c6d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肿瘤的严重性和肿瘤的大小没有关系，只要位置不在关键内脏，对生命的威胁就不太大，而且一般巨大肿瘤肯定是良性肿瘤，因为如果是恶性肿瘤，没法长得这么大。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"decfaea8-d9c1-4ffc-a8bd-7f1492c27b83","children":[{"bold":true,"type":"formatted","text":"良性肿瘤和恶性肿瘤的区别在于是否会发生转移"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，良性肿瘤就像钉子户，始终在那里，一般通过手术切除也就恢复了。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"19c84b5a-8c17-4de0-a538-3ed9ef4e0246","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么肿瘤转移这么可怕，要是肿瘤不动，切了也就是了，但是发生了转移，保不准转移到重要地方，影响此处细胞的生存空间。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"4159613f-8a7a-4378-bcad-f0d17039e256","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最常见的转移，脑转移，肺转移，骨转移，肝转移，这四个地方有个共同点：很重要，这就会导致治疗策略很保守，无法完全去除肿瘤。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"1dd62fac-4ded-4459-b38a-ae0710d5f66e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如乳腺癌，如果发现的早，还没有扩散，把乳腺或者乳房摘除就好了，还能健康活个几十年，但是如果发生了扩散，转移到了脑部，那不能把脑子给摘除了，就很难治了。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"868e028c-86ea-4d5f-81b3-3e19d6a43a7f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外恶性肿瘤的转移也不是长到一定程度才发生，可能在很小还检测不到时候就发生了转移，因此就会出现很多患者刚确诊就发现癌症已经转移到了全身。"}]},{"calloutType":"info","disableDrag":false,"title":"信息","type":"callout","collabId":"6e0f7a6e-730d-4dd8-8e6f-c5f0b68be045","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","collabId":"92007b45-8c33-442c-ba83-2092c64aa65f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"很多癌症会先转移到淋巴结，然后顺着淋巴系统转移到其他系统，因此可以对肿瘤附近的淋巴结做穿刺检查，如果淋巴结中没有肿瘤细胞，就说肿瘤还没有发生转移，就可以通过局部治疗控制住疾病。"}]}]}],"tags":["医学/癌症","医学/肿瘤"],"createTime":1771046256628,"updateTime":1791090908447,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791090908447}}